#!/bin/sh

myip=$(curl --noproxy '*' -fsS --max-time 3 http://169.254.169.254/metadata/v1/interfaces/public/0/ipv4/address) || myip='<droplet-public-ip>'
cat <<EOF
********************************************************************************
Welcome to DigitalOcean's 1-Click Alby Hub Droplet.

Open https://${myip} in your browser (no domain or SSH tunnel needed).
On this authenticated SSH/Droplet console, run as root:
    cat /opt/albyhub/.env
Enter only the value after SETUP_CODE= in Hub's existing setup-code screen.
This unique code protects initial setup/restore; it is NOT your unlock password.
The code is not printed in this banner or placed in a browser URL.

HTTPS provisioning can take a few minutes. On failure it retries hourly.
Never bypass certificate warnings or send credentials over public HTTP.
To inspect/retry HTTPS:
    journalctl -u albyhub-https.service -n 50 --no-pager
    systemctl start albyhub-https.service
    systemctl list-timers albyhub-https.timer

UFW allows SSH (22), ACME challenges only (80), and HTTPS (443).
Hub's HTTP port 8080 is bound only to 127.0.0.1 behind Nginx.
Compose and data: /opt/albyhub and /opt/albyhub/data
    cd /opt/albyhub && docker compose ps
    cd /opt/albyhub && docker compose logs -f

Help: https://getalby.com
Issues: https://github.com/getAlby/hub
********************************************************************************
EOF
